<title>USA: Crop Growers to pay $2.5 mln in settlement.</title>
<headline>Crop Growers to pay $2.5 mln in settlement.</headline>
<dateline>OVERLAND PARK, Kan. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crop Growers Corp said Monday it agreed to settle the shareholder action filed against it and two of its former officers and pay $2.5 million.</p>
<p>The company said it would pay the settlement to members of a class consisting of purchasers of the common stock during the period from Feb. 13, 1995, to May 16, 1995.</p>
<p>The company said it would accrue the cost of the settlement, still subject to court approval, in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
